# Published versions of standard: <X.Y> <sha256 of the canonical form of
# standard-<X.Y>.ini>.
#
# One line per version, appended when a version is published and never edited:
# a test (bench::spec) fails when a standard-<X.Y>.ini's rules do not match the line of
# its Version, so a rule changed without a new Version, or a published version
# changed in place, cannot reach a build. The digest covers the rules
# (bench::spec::canonical), not comments or layout. Procedure:
# .agents/skills/bench-spec/SKILL.md.
